This repository contains the code for homi: inference, evaluation, training-data builders and training. It is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). It contains no model weights and no training audio.
The trained model (adapter, decision head, temperature) is published separately at
https://huggingface.co/egma-ai/homi with its own NOTICE and per-clip credits.

The model runs on Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Instruct by the Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud (Apache License, Version 2.0), which
the code downloads from Hugging Face. The datasets, models and tools that the scripts download keep their own
licences; see data/DATA.md and each builder's README.

Third-party data files in this repository
-----------------------------------------
- data/sb_voice/crema_demographics.json: actor age and gender extracted from CREMA-D's VideoDemographics.csv
  (Cao et al., 2014). This file is made available under the Open Database License (ODbL v1.0); its contents under the
  Database Contents License (DbCL v1.0). It is not covered by the Apache License.
- data/sb_voice/librispeech_speaker_gender.json and data/sb_count/librispeech_speaker_gender.json: reader gender from
  LibriSpeech's SPEAKERS.TXT (Panayotov et al., 2015; CC BY 4.0), reader names removed.
- data/sb_tasksource/task_licenses.json: licence fields of tasksource tasks, used to keep only commercially licensed,
  non-share-alike tasks.
